---
// AirportGuideFeatured.astro
---

<section class="space-y-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white dark:from-slate-800/50 dark:to-slate-900 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-sm">
  <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-3">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/50 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 text-xs font-bold rounded-full">
      <span>📖</span> 2026 最新魔法上网入门与选型指南
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
      机场实力榜 稳定梯子推荐与小白魔法上网配置教程
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      帮助第一次接触机场的小白建立科学选择标准 告别盲目跟风 真正找到适合自己的稳定方案。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-sm space-y-3">
    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
      <span>💡</span> 选机场的核心观念 别再只看谁速度最快
    </h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      很多新手挑机场的第一反应是看峰值速度。但真正长期使用就会发现，单纯追求跑分意义并不大。一个节点晚高峰频繁波动，实际体验远不如长期保持稳定的节点。判断一家机场的真正实力，需要综合考量线路稳定性、晚高峰表现、常用节点质量、套餐价格、可用流量与使用门槛。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-4">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
      <span>🔍</span> 真正有实力的机场 应该看这 5 项指标
    </h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
      <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-1">维度一</div>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">晚高峰稳定性</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            晚上 20 点至 23 点高需求时段节点依旧保持连通，实际参考价值远高于凌晨跑分。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-1">维度二</div>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">常用地区优质节点</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            集中维护香港、日本、新加坡与美国等高频地区备用线路，胜过大量无人维护冷门节点。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-1">维度三</div>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">合理套餐设计</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            按需选择几十 GB 到几百 GB 流量包，不强迫所有用户购买昂贵的大流量套餐。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-1">维度四</div>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">低使用门槛</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            提供清晰的全平台客户端教程，买得到且学会用，确保新手轻松上手。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-1">维度五</div>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">故障恢复能力</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            具备成熟的线路冗余与备用节点，出现波动后能够快速恢复连接。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
    <div class="p-5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-4">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>🎯</span> 按需划分 4 大适用人群档位
      </h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
        <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-700/50 rounded-xl space-y-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm block mb-1">性价比档</span>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">适合第一次购买的新手 价格低 套餐灵活 使用简单 常用节点够用 月付试用。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-700/50 rounded-xl space-y-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm block mb-1">稳定档</span>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">适合高频日常办公与高频使用者 重视晚高峰表现与低波动连通。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-700/50 rounded-xl space-y-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm block mb-1">影音档</span>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">适合 4K 影音与高清视频用户 充沛流量带宽与全平台解锁。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3.5 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-700/50 rounded-xl space-y-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm block mb-1">进阶档</span>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">适合对线路与低延迟有更高要求的用户 选用 IPLC 专线与中转方案。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-4">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>🛡️</span> 小白买机场避坑 3 不原则
      </h3>
      <div class="space-y-3 text-xs">
        <div class="p-3 bg-amber-50/70 dark:bg-amber-900/20 border border-amber-200/60 dark:border-amber-700/50 rounded-xl space-y-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200 text-sm">原则一 不直接年付</span>
          <p class="text-amber-800/80 dark:text-amber-300/80 leading-relaxed">
            第一次使用优先考虑月付 确认稳定后再考虑长期订阅 避免承担不确定风险。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-blue-50/70 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border border-blue-200/60 dark:border-blue-700/50 rounded-xl space-y-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm">原则二 不迷信无限流量</span>
          <p class="text-blue-800/80 dark:text-blue-300/80 leading-relaxed">
            绝大多数普通用户不需要无限流量 线路质量与连通可用性更加关键。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-emerald-50/70 dark:bg-emerald-900/20 border border-emerald-200/60 dark:border-emerald-700/50 rounded-xl space-y-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-200 text-sm">原则三 不迷信节点数量</span>
          <p class="text-emerald-800/80 dark:text-emerald-300/80 leading-relaxed">
            常用节点质量远比几百个冷门无人维护节点重要 质量优于数量。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-4">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
      <span>📱</span> 买完机场怎么用 全平台新手配置步骤
    </h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-xs">
      <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>💻</span> Windows 用户
        </h4>
        <div class="space-y-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>1 安装支持订阅格式的客户端</p>
          <p>2 在机场后台复制订阅地址</p>
          <p>3 粘贴至配置界面并一键更新</p>
          <p>4 选择常用节点并开启系统代理</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>🍏</span> macOS 用户
        </h4>
        <div class="space-y-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>1 确认客户端兼容订阅格式</p>
          <p>2 导入订阅并刷新节点列表</p>
          <p>3 优先选择较近地区测试连通</p>
          <p>4 遇速度下降尝试切换同区节点</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>🤖</span> Android 用户
        </h4>
        <div class="space-y-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>1 下载兼容的代理客户端应用</p>
          <p>2 复制订阅地址并添加配置</p>
          <p>3 更新拉取节点并选定节点</p>
          <p>4 启动连接允许系统代理权限</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>📱</span> iOS 用户
        </h4>
        <div class="space-y-1 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>1 获取兼容客户端软件</p>
          <p>2 添加订阅配置并完成更新</p>
          <p>3 首次开启时授权创建网络配置</p>
          <p>4 选中低延迟节点开始使用</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs">
    <div class="p-5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-3">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>❓</span> 常见问题简答
      </h3>
      <div class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p><strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">机场越贵越稳定吗：</strong>不一定 体验还会受到运营商与本地网络环境影响。</p>
        <p><strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">节点显示 50ms 却很慢：</strong>延迟低不等于下载快 需看当前负载与单线程带宽。</p>
        <p><strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">机场突然变慢怎么排查：</strong>先切同区节点 再切其他地区 更新订阅与检查本地网络。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-3 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span>📌</span> 选梯子核心顺序总结
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          建议遵循以下标准顺序：先确定预算，判断每月流量需求，选择常用地区，进行短周期月付测试，观察晚高峰表现，满意后再决定长期订阅。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-3 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-700/70 rounded-xl font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 text-center mt-3">
        先看需求 再看线路 短期测试 决定长期
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
